== Trivia ==
* "Ipecac" is a shortened name for [[wikipedia:syrup of ipecac|syrup of ipecac]], a powerful emetic (a substance used to induce vomiting). This name is itself derived from a shortening of the source plant's name, Ipecacuanha. Production of ipecac syrup has been discontinued since 2010.
* This item is used in {{chal|Suicide King}}.
* In the ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC for the original game, this item was unlocked by default.

